{"seq":3,"slug":"state-management-mobile","title":"移动端状态管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/cross-cutting/state-management-mobile","wordCount":1212,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"移动端状态管理\">移动端状态管理</h1><p>状态管理是移动端架构的核心战场。一个中型应用可能同时维护：用户认证状态（全局）、购物车内容（跨屏幕共享）、列表滚动位置（页面局部）、网络请求加载状态（组件级）、动画进度（帧级）。如何让这些不同生命周期、不同作用域的状态和谐共存而不互相干扰，是每个架构方案都必须回答的问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>状态分层</strong>：按作用域将状态分为应用级、会话级、屏幕级、组件级和瞬态五层，每层使用匹配的持有机制</li>\n<li><strong>单一数据源（SSOT）</strong>：每条数据只有一个权威来源，多个消费者通过订阅获取最新值而非各自缓存</li>\n<li><strong>Scope 精确匹配</strong>：状态的生命周期必须与持有者的生命周期对齐——不要用全局 Store 管组件级状态</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"状态的分类学\">状态的分类学</h2><p>按作用域和生命周期，移动端状态可以分为五个层次：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>作用域</th>\n<th>生命周期</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>典型持有者</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>应用级</td>\n<td>全局</td>\n<td>进程生命周期</td>\n<td>认证 Token、主题、语言</td>\n<td>Application/AppDelegate</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>会话级</td>\n<td>登录会话</td>\n<td>登录→登出</td>\n<td>用户信息、权限、购物车</td>\n<td>Session Store</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>屏幕级</td>\n<td>单个页面</td>\n<td>页面创建→销毁</td>\n<td>列表数据、表单状态</td>\n<td>ViewModel</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>组件级</td>\n<td>UI 组件</td>\n<td>组件挂载→卸载</td>\n<td>展开/折叠、动画</td>\n<td>State/remember</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>瞬态</td>\n<td>单次操作</td>\n<td>创建→消费</td>\n<td>Toast、导航事件</td>\n<td>Channel/Event</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>状态复杂度</mtext><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mtext>states</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mtext>transitions</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mtext>dependencies</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{状态复杂度} = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} \\text{states}_i \\times \\text{transitions}_i \\times \\text{dependencies}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">状态复杂度</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">states</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8179em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">transitions</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dependencies</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"单一数据源原则-single-source-of-truth\">单一数据源原则（Single Source of Truth）</h2><p>每条数据只应有一个权威来源。当同一数据在多个地方被&quot;缓存&quot;时，一致性问题不可避免：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;反模式:多源&quot;&#10;        API1[API 响应] --&gt; VM1[ViewModel A]&#10;        API1 --&gt; VM2[ViewModel B]&#10;        DB1[本地 DB] --&gt; VM1&#10;        DB1 --&gt; VM2&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;正确:单一源&quot;&#10;        API2[API] --&gt; REPO[&quot;Repository&lt;br/&gt;唯一真相源&quot;]&#10;        DB2[DB] --&gt; REPO&#10;        REPO --&gt;|&quot;Flow/Combine&quot;| VM3[ViewModel A]&#10;        REPO --&gt;|&quot;Flow/Combine&quot;| VM4[ViewModel B]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph \"反模式:多源\"\n        API1[API 响应] --&gt; VM1[ViewModel A]\n        API1 --&gt; VM2[ViewModel B]\n        DB1[本地 DB] --&gt; VM1\n        DB1 --&gt; VM2\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"正确:单一源\"\n        API2[API] --&gt; REPO[\"Repository&lt;br/&gt;唯一真相源\"]\n        DB2[DB] --&gt; REPO\n        REPO --&gt;|\"Flow/Combine\"| VM3[ViewModel A]\n        REPO --&gt;|\"Flow/Combine\"| VM4[ViewModel B]\n    end</pre><p>Repository 作为唯一真相源，内部决定数据来自网络还是缓存。ViewModel 只订阅 Repository 暴露的数据流——当 Repository 更新时，所有订阅者自动收到最新值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"android-状态管理工具链\">Android 状态管理工具链</h2><h3 id=\"stateflow-compose\">StateFlow + Compose</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class CartViewModel @Inject constructor(&#10;    private val cartRepository: CartRepository&#10;) : ViewModel() {&#10;&#10;    // 屏幕级状态：组合多个数据源&#10;    val uiState: StateFlow&lt;CartUiState&gt; = combine(&#10;        cartRepository.cartItems,&#10;        cartRepository.totalPrice,&#10;        cartRepository.appliedCoupon&#10;    ) { items, price, coupon -&gt;&#10;        CartUiState(&#10;            items = items.map { it.toUiModel() },&#10;            totalPrice = price,&#10;            couponText = coupon?.code ?: &quot;&quot;,&#10;            canCheckout = items.isNotEmpty()&#10;        )&#10;    }.stateIn(&#10;        scope = viewModelScope,&#10;        started = SharingStarted.WhileSubscribed(5000),&#10;        initialValue = CartUiState()&#10;    )&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class CartViewModel @Inject constructor(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val cartRepository: CartRepository</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) : ViewModel() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 屏幕级状态：组合多个数据源</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val uiState: StateFlow&#x3C;CartUiState> = combine(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        cartRepository.cartItems,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        cartRepository.totalPrice,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        cartRepository.appliedCoupon</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) { items, price, coupon -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        CartUiState(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            items = items.map { it.toUiModel() },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            totalPrice = price,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            couponText = coupon?.code ?: \"\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            canCheckout = items.isNotEmpty()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }.stateIn(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        scope = viewModelScope,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        started = SharingStarted.WhileSubscribed(5000),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        initialValue = CartUiState()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>SharingStarted.WhileSubscribed(5000)</code> 的含义：最后一个订阅者取消 5 秒后停止上游 Flow 收集。这平衡了&quot;配置变更时不中断&quot;和&quot;后台不浪费资源&quot;。</p>\n<h3 id=\"savedstatehandle-进程恢复\">SavedStateHandle：进程恢复</h3><p>Android 的进程可能在后台被系统杀死。<code>SavedStateHandle</code> 将关键状态序列化到 Bundle，进程恢复时自动还原：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class SearchViewModel @Inject constructor(&#10;    private val savedStateHandle: SavedStateHandle&#10;) : ViewModel() {&#10;    // 自动持久化到 SavedStateHandle&#10;    val searchQuery = savedStateHandle.getStateFlow(&quot;query&quot;, &quot;&quot;)&#10;&#10;    fun updateQuery(query: String) {&#10;        savedStateHandle[&quot;query&quot;] = query&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class SearchViewModel @Inject constructor(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val savedStateHandle: SavedStateHandle</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) : ViewModel() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 自动持久化到 SavedStateHandle</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val searchQuery = savedStateHandle.getStateFlow(\"query\", \"\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun updateQuery(query: String) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        savedStateHandle[\"query\"] = query</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态类型</th>\n<th>存储位置</th>\n<th>配置变更</th>\n<th>进程杀死</th>\n<th>应用卸载</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ViewModel 内存</td>\n<td>RAM</td>\n<td>存活</td>\n<td>丢失</td>\n<td>丢失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SavedStateHandle</td>\n<td>Bundle → 磁盘</td>\n<td>存活</td>\n<td>恢复</td>\n<td>丢失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DataStore/Room</td>\n<td>磁盘</td>\n<td>存活</td>\n<td>存活</td>\n<td>丢失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Server</td>\n<td>云端</td>\n<td>存活</td>\n<td>存活</td>\n<td>存活</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"ios-状态管理工具链\">iOS 状态管理工具链</h2><h3 id=\"swiftui-state-家族\">SwiftUI @State 家族</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"struct ProductListView: View {&#10;    // 组件级：View 私有&#10;    @State private var isFilterExpanded = false&#10;&#10;    // 屏幕级：ViewModel 持有&#10;    @StateObject private var viewModel = ProductListViewModel()&#10;&#10;    // 会话级：从环境注入&#10;    @EnvironmentObject private var cartStore: CartStore&#10;&#10;    var body: some View {&#10;        List(viewModel.products) { product in&#10;            ProductRow(product: product)&#10;                .onTapGesture { cartStore.add(product) }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProductListView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">View </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 组件级：View 私有</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    @State</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> isFilterExpanded </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 屏幕级：ViewModel 持有</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    @StateObject</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> viewModel </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ProductListViewModel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 会话级：从环境注入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    @EnvironmentObject</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> private</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cartStore: CartStore</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> body: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">some</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> View {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        List</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(viewModel.products) { product </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            ProductRow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">product</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: product)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">onTapGesture</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { cartStore.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(product) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Property Wrapper</th>\n<th>所有权</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>@State</code></td>\n<td>View 自身</td>\n<td>简单的 UI 级状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@StateObject</code></td>\n<td>View 创建并持有</td>\n<td>ObservableObject 的生命周期绑定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@ObservedObject</code></td>\n<td>外部传入</td>\n<td>不拥有，只观察</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@EnvironmentObject</code></td>\n<td>祖先 View 注入</td>\n<td>跨多层 View 共享</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@Environment</code></td>\n<td>SwiftUI 系统</td>\n<td>系统级（colorScheme, locale）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"observable-宏-swift-5-9\">Observable 宏（Swift 5.9+）</h3><p>Swift 5.9 的 <code>@Observable</code> 宏提供了比 <code>ObservableObject</code> + <code>@Published</code> 更细粒度的观察能力——只有实际被 View body 读取的属性变化才触发重绘：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"@Observable&#10;class CartStore {&#10;    var items: [CartItem] = []&#10;    var totalPrice: Decimal = 0&#10;    var isCheckoutEnabled: Bool { !items.isEmpty }&#10;&#10;    func add(_ product: Product) {&#10;        items.append(CartItem(product: product, quantity: 1))&#10;        totalPrice = items.reduce(0) { $0 + $1.product.price * Decimal($1.quantity) }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@Observable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CartStore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> items: [CartItem] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> totalPrice: Decimal </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> isCheckoutEnabled: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">items.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">isEmpty</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> product: Product) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        items.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">append</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">CartItem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">product</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: product, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">quantity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        totalPrice </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> items.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">reduce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">$0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> $1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.product.price </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Decimal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">$1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.quantity) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"跨屏幕状态共享模式\">跨屏幕状态共享模式</h2><p>当多个屏幕需要共享状态时（如购物车、用户偏好），有三种常见模式：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph &quot;模式A:全局 Store&quot;&#10;        GS[&quot;Global Store&lt;br/&gt;Singleton&quot;] --&gt;|订阅| VM1A[ViewModel A]&#10;        GS --&gt;|订阅| VM2A[ViewModel B]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;模式B:事件总线&quot;&#10;        VM1B[ViewModel A] --&gt;|发送事件| EB[Event Bus]&#10;        EB --&gt;|分发| VM2B[ViewModel B]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;模式C:父级 Store&quot;&#10;        PS[Parent Store] --&gt;|传递 Binding| VM1C[Child VM A]&#10;        PS --&gt;|传递 Binding| VM2C[Child VM B]&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph \"模式A:全局 Store\"\n        GS[\"Global Store&lt;br/&gt;Singleton\"] --&gt;|订阅| VM1A[ViewModel A]\n        GS --&gt;|订阅| VM2A[ViewModel B]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"模式B:事件总线\"\n        VM1B[ViewModel A] --&gt;|发送事件| EB[Event Bus]\n        EB --&gt;|分发| VM2B[ViewModel B]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"模式C:父级 Store\"\n        PS[Parent Store] --&gt;|传递 Binding| VM1C[Child VM A]\n        PS --&gt;|传递 Binding| VM2C[Child VM B]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n<th>适合场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全局 Store</td>\n<td>简单直观</td>\n<td>全局可变状态难追踪</td>\n<td>少量全局数据（认证、主题）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事件总线</td>\n<td>完全解耦</td>\n<td>难以追踪事件流向、调试困难</td>\n<td>低频跨模块通知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>父级 Store</td>\n<td>作用域清晰</td>\n<td>传递链可能过长</td>\n<td>同一导航流内的页面</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"状态一致性保证\">状态一致性保证</h2><p>分布式状态的一致性是移动端的核心难题——网络延迟、乐观更新、后台推送都可能导致客户端状态与服务端不一致。</p>\n<p><strong>乐观更新 + 回滚策略：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"fun toggleFavorite(productId: String) {&#10;    // 乐观更新：立即反映到 UI&#10;    _state.update { state -&gt;&#10;        state.copy(favorites = state.favorites.toggle(productId))&#10;    }&#10;    // 异步确认：失败则回滚&#10;    viewModelScope.launch {&#10;        repository.toggleFavorite(productId).onFailure {&#10;            _state.update { state -&gt;&#10;                state.copy(favorites = state.favorites.toggle(productId)) // 回滚&#10;            }&#10;            _effects.send(Effect.ShowError(&quot;操作失败，已恢复&quot;))&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fun toggleFavorite(productId: String) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 乐观更新：立即反映到 UI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    _state.update { state -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        state.copy(favorites = state.favorites.toggle(productId))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 异步确认：失败则回滚</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    viewModelScope.launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        repository.toggleFavorite(productId).onFailure {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            _state.update { state -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                state.copy(favorites = state.favorites.toggle(productId)) // 回滚</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            _effects.send(Effect.ShowError(\"操作失败，已恢复\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>一致</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>网络失败</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>用户继续操作导致冲突</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(\\text{一致}) = 1 - P(\\text{网络失败}) \\times P(\\text{用户继续操作导致冲突})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">一致</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">网络失败</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">用户继续操作导致冲突</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>状态管理的工具和模式选择应该基于状态的作用域和生命周期——不要用全局 Store 管理组件级状态，也不要用 <code>@State</code> 管理需要跨屏幕共享的数据。这与 <a href=\"dependency-injection-mobile\">依赖注入</a> 的 Scope 对齐原则一致——状态的 Scope 应该与其持有者的生命周期精确匹配。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>移动端状态管理的复杂性来自&quot;多种生命周期的状态需要在同一个应用中和谐共存&quot;。解决方案不是选一个&quot;万能的全局 Store&quot;，而是按作用域分层——每种状态使用与其生命周期匹配的持有机制。Android 的 StateFlow + SavedStateHandle + DataStore 三件套和 iOS 的 @State/@StateObject/@Observable 家族分别提供了从组件级到应用级的完整工具链。单一数据源原则和乐观更新 + 回滚策略是保证分布式状态一致性的两个核心实践。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"移动端状态管理","id":"移动端状态管理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"状态的分类学","id":"状态的分类学"},{"level":2,"text":"单一数据源原则（Single Source of Truth）","id":"单一数据源原则-single-source-of-truth"},{"level":2,"text":"Android 状态管理工具链","id":"android-状态管理工具链"},{"level":3,"text":"StateFlow + Compose","id":"stateflow-compose"},{"level":3,"text":"SavedStateHandle：进程恢复","id":"savedstatehandle-进程恢复"},{"level":2,"text":"iOS 状态管理工具链","id":"ios-状态管理工具链"},{"level":3,"text":"SwiftUI @State 家族","id":"swiftui-state-家族"},{"level":3,"text":"Observable 宏（Swift 5.9+）","id":"observable-宏-swift-5-9"},{"level":2,"text":"跨屏幕状态共享模式","id":"跨屏幕状态共享模式"},{"level":2,"text":"状态一致性保证","id":"状态一致性保证"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"导航与路由模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/cross-cutting/navigation-routing-patterns"},"next":{"title":"架构测试策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/practice/architecture-testing-strategies"}}